      "extract": "[]{#sec:adonis_cascade label=\"sec:adonis_cascade\"} The hadrons produced at the vertex propagate through the residual nucleus and undergo final-state interactions, modelled with a JAX re-implementation of the intranuclear cascade used in ACHILLES [@Isaacson:2020wlx]: elastic and inelastic nucleon--nucleon and pion--nucleon scattering, pion absorption, and charge exchange. Everything at the vertex is a smooth function",
